@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Part Provision Team
|a_default|
start
-> Identify the parts;
:identify parts;
-> Check if information needs to be elicited;
:does the team need to elicit information from the customer?;
:v1: does the team need to elicit information from the customer? ({Need to check availability, Already have availability information, Parts supplied to customer}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Need to check availability'])
:check availability of the parts;
-> Check if parts are available or need ordering;
:do the parts need to be ordered and received from Disuki?;
:v2: do the parts need to be ordered and received from Disuki? ({Order not needed  proceed, Order and receive the part}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Order and receive the part'])
:record customer details;
:order part from Disuki;
:receive part from Disuki;
-> Contact the customer or after receiving parts;
else ([v2 = 'Order not needed  proceed'])
->;
endif
:contact the customer;
-> Proceed with process or after contacting customer;
else ([v1 = 'Already have availability information'] [v1 = 'Parts supplied to customer'])
->;
endif
:collect all necessary parts;
-> Proceed to payment step;
:proceed with payment;
-> Payment completed;
:end of process;
stop
